{"url": "https://janatacollege.in/#####", "retrieved": "2026-10-02", "status": "ok", "final_url": "https://janatacollege.in/#%23%23%23%23", "text": "janatacollege – Premier Institute of Higher Learning\nContact Us @ 03842-273446 /\nprincipal@janatacollege.in\nHome\nAbout\nBrief History\nPrincipal Desk\nMission\nAffiliation\nRules & Regulations\nUniform\nRight to Information Act\nContact us\nPeople\nAdministration\nFaculty\nAlumni\nCommittees\nStudent’s Union\nAcademics\nCourses\nHigher Secondary\nGraduation\nSelf Financing Courses\nProgram Outcomes\nFee Structure\nAcademic Calendar\nActivities Calendar\nWorkshops/Seminars/Conferences\nResult\nHoliday List\nAcademics Record\nScholarship\nRoutine\nKKHSOU\nRecords\nAdmission\nOnline Admission\nDegree\nHigher Secondary\nGeneral Information\nEligibility\nFee Structure\nFacilities\nCentral Library\nGirl’s Hostel\nCollege Canteen\nGymnasium\nHealth Centre\nOther Facilities\nPlacement\nOn Campus\nOff Campus\nIQAC\nNIRF\n2023-24\n2024-25\n2025-26\n*Janata College submitted a declaration to APEX SDG and to itself to make the College campus plastic free with the motto 'BEAT THE PLASTIC POLLUTION' from 8th Aug.*\nNIRF 2024-25 DATA\nCertificate Proforma (Exam/Class)\nFYUG Admission 2026-27 Round-2 Merit List\nJanata College, Kabuganj – Premier Institute of Higher Learning!\nJanata College, established in 1964 by a galaxy of dedicated nationalists, philanthropists and academics, with a pious vision to disseminate higher education in the remote parts of the Barak Valley. The college is situated at Kabuganj at a distance of 20 Km to the South-East of Silchar.\nCourse Structure for FYUGP\nSubject Combination for Four Year Degree Course (FYUG) according to NEP 2020\nClick here for CBCS Syllabus Assam University Silchar\nDo inhaled steroids increase the risk of pneumonia in people with chronic obstructive pulmonary disease (COPD)? | Cochrane\naus roids\nhow to warm up properly? – anabolic menu\nFROM THE PRINCIPAL’S DESK\n“We want education by which character is formed, strength of mind is increased, the intellect is expanded and by which one can stand on one’s own feet.”\nSwami Vivekananda\nEducation is considered to be an instrument that can drive away ignorance and illuminate the mind of a man to righteous thought and action. It empowers an individual (student) and enlarges the horizon of her/ his mind. It enables a man not only to earn his living but also teaches him to live with dignity and honor.  At Janata College we cherish this value of education and our objective is to let every student live a respectful life. We also value igniting the spark of creativity and curiosity in our students.\nRead More\nNotice & News\nWalk-in interview for teaching and non-teaching at Janata College, Kabuganj\nAdmission Notice for FYUG 3rd and 5th sem 2026-27\nOnline application for Dr. Bani Kanta Kakati Merit Award, 2026\nAdmission Notice for HS XII 2026-27\nNotice for APAAR/ABC ID creation 2026\nFYUG spot admission 2026-27\nAdmission Notice for HS XII 2026-27\nFYUG 2nd merit list 2026-27\nFYUG 1st merit list 2026-27\nFYUG Admission Notification 2026-27\nAdmission Form for FYUG Programme 2026\nDocument verification date for HS 1st yr. admission 2026\nNotification on Admission for HS 1st yr. 2026\nFYUG Examination Online Form 2026\nCBSC Examination Online Form 2026\nACPC-IAS Coaching Scholarship 2025\nNotification on FYUG SPOT Admission (Non-CUET)\nNotification on Fee Structure and documents requirement for FYUG admission Round-2\nRound 2 : NON-CUET/Class XII based Merit List for Bachelor of Arts(AU FoA)\nNotification on HS 2nd year admission 2025-26\nNotification on Fee Structure and documents requirement for FYUG admission\nHoliday notice and admission date for FYUG round 1 admission\nRound 1 : NON-CUET/Class XII based Merit List for Bachelor of Arts(AU FoA)\nDocument Scrutiny and Admission for HS 2025\nHS 1st Year Admission 2025\nExam Notices/Results\nSamarth Enrollment No.\n1st Sem\n3rd Sem\n5th Sem\nOnl